 "rule": "tests/hidden/selection.json (selection rule sha256 a6b5f8beb814085a94206efaf46120aafd759ea4cffb818e07a35723f640cd33, pinned 2026-11-19T00:51:35Z): the 10 hidden sites the rule selected, in seed order, are h01..h10; the episode seed of each is its site seed (the cell derives the set-down and every noise stream from it)",
 "note": "verify.py takes the first `episodes` (grader_config.json: 10) entries; each archive's sha256 is checked before its episode. seed = the pinned episode seed; site_seed = the generator seed of the package (w3gen 0.1.0, the rubble under the slab included; a copy in tests/review/sitegen/w3gen); candidate = its name in the selection; reference_* = the privileged reference's admission run on the same package geometry and episode seed (its final state is what the oracle reproduces bit for bit)"
}
